---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY MAPPING (web → native)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  data:   ChargingSession slice {start_soc_pct, end_soc_pct, peak_power_w(W, SI),
            charger_type}                                   → SessionCurveInput (Adapter)
  curve:  generateChargingCurve(session) — start_soc_pct??0 → end_soc_pct??100 step 1;
            peak=(peak_power_w??11_000)/1000 kW; isDcSession = truthy charger_type OR
            peak_power_w>20_000; AC flat at peak; DC plateau≤50, linear taper 50–80 to
            half-peak, steeper roll-off 80–100; max(power,0) → SessionCurveBuilder.generateCurve
  datum:  CurvePoint {soc, power(kW)}                       → SessionCurvePoint {soc, power}
  round:  ChartContainer data table `Math.round(p.power*10)/10` → SessionCurveBuilder.roundedPower
            (kept as `chartData`; the chart plots the raw `points`, exactly like the web)
  shell:  <ChartContainer title subtitle ariaLabel data dataColumns exportable> → TSFadeIn +
            tokenized glass card (Color.TS.surface + TSRadius.lg + Color.TS.border), header +
            subtitle
  chart:  Recharts <AreaChart><Area type="monotone" stroke={CHART_COLORS[0]}
            fill="url(#curvePowerGrad)" strokeWidth=2 unit=" kW"> + CartesianGrid + XAxis
            (label "SOC (%)") + YAxis (label "Power (kW)")  → Swift Charts Chart{ AreaMark
            (gradient fill, .interpolationMethod(.monotone)) under LineMark (2 pt stroke) },
            .chartXAxisLabel "SOC (%)" / .chartYAxisLabel "Power (kW)", dashed token grid.
  color:  CHART_COLORS[0] = #0072B2 (Okabe-Ito CB-safe blue) → Color.TS.chartCategorical[0]
            (index-stable brand palette slot 0, value-identical across platforms)
  fill:   areaGradient(id, color, 0.3) stop 0%→0.3 … 95%→0.02 → LinearGradient
            [seriesColor.opacity(0.3) … 0.02] top→bottom
  tip:    <Tooltip content={<ChartTooltip/>}> (Power N kW at hovered SOC)
            → SessionCurveTooltip via .chartXSelection RuleMark+PointMark annotation (snapped)
  table:  ChartContainer data + dataColumns (SOC % / Power (kW)) accessible fallback
            → AXChartDescriptor (every (SOC %, Power kW) point as a continuous data series —
            the Apple-idiomatic "view as table"; better than a 100-row visual grid)
  i18n:   every t(key,default) from source resolved through SessionCurveStrings facade
            (table "SessionCurveChart"); no English literal ships.

i18n keys from source (all present in SessionCurveChart.strings, P1/S10 catalog):
  charging.curve.powerVsSoc · charging.curve.powerVsSocDesc · charging.curve.powerVsSoc.aria ·
  charging.curve.col.soc · charging.curve.col.power · charging.curve.socPercent ·
  charging.curve.powerKw · charging.curve.power · common.noData

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface):
  loading  → SessionCurveLoadingChart (TSSkeleton bars in a DC-taper silhouette; reduce-motion safe)
  content  → SessionCurveAreaChart (area + line + selection tooltip + AX data series)
  empty    → SessionCurveEmpty (ContentUnavailableView, web common.noData) — never blank;
             reached when no session is selected OR the SOC span is non-positive
  error    → SessionCurveError (QueryError-equiv, Retry → model.refresh())
  stale    → freshness chip (Stale) + connectivity banner + one guarded auto-refresh
  offline  → freshness chip (Offline) + banner; keeps the cached curve, no refetch
a11y: container summary (title + peak kW + SOC span), per-point VoiceOver via the
  AXChartDescriptor data series, reduce-motion animation gate, Dynamic Type via system
  fonts/tokens, VoiceOver labels on the retry control + freshness chip.
telemetry: P1/S11 view.opened(surface:"SessionCurveChart") emitted once on appear.

